"拖动文集和标签排序，右键标签调整颜色。" = "Drag collections and tags to reorder them; right-click a tag to change its color.";
"在列表中按回车打开 PDF，按空格快速预览。" = "Press Return to open a PDF or Space for Quick Look in the paper list.";
"阅读时维护引用信息、笔记和标注。" = "Keep citation details, notes, and annotations as you read.";
"检查器中的编辑自动保存，无需点击保存按钮。" = "Inspector edits save automatically.";
"在高级字段中固定常用字段，或添加自定义字段。" = "Pin useful fields or add custom fields in Advanced Fields.";
"到设置中配置文件库，并定期导出带附件的备份。" = "Configure a File Library in Settings and regularly back up linked files.";
"文库侧栏、文献表格和检查器使用原生窗口组件；菜单操作跟随当前文库窗口。" = "The library sidebar, paper table, and inspector use native macOS components. Menu commands follow the active library window.";
"独立 DOI、ISBN 和预印本编号，15 种文献类型，高级字段、自定义字段和固定字段。" = "Independent DOI, ISBN, and eprint identifiers; 15 paper types; advanced, custom, and pinned fields.";
"文集层级和标签拖动排序、自定义标签颜色，以及文件库整理和单独重命名。" = "Reorder collections and tags, customize tag colors, organize files, and rename them independently.";
